WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.860
Hey guys,
C.S. Lewis said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:08.880
we believe in God as we believe in the sun
Not because it exists, but because by it we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.700
can see everything else.
And it is so true.&nbsp;

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.340
I'm looking at the sunrise here.
Look at this.&nbsp;

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.160
It was pitch dark just a few minutes ago.&nbsp;

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:29.580
God is amazing.
Remember to enjoy life.&nbsp;

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:36.240
Jesus said He came so that we can&nbsp;
have life and have it abundantly.&nbsp;

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.040
It's a choice that you sometimes make.
So go and enjoy life with Him.

